      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds a bit one-sided. You're saying the benefits \"far outweigh\" the drawbacks, but isn't it true that when capital leaves a country because of high taxes, it actually hurts the very people trying to help the poor by shrinking the economy and reducing jobs? Why isn't that considered a more definitive risk?",
